  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Providing Support to the Government of Iceland for the Resettlement and Family Reunification (2022 - 2024)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This project contributes to providing durable solutions to 220 beneficiaries of international protection in Iran (the Islamic republic of), Kenya, Lebanon and Pakistan by facilitating their resettlement to Iceland, as well as contribute to family unity for 210 family members of beneficiaries of international/subsidiary protection residing in Iceland by facilitating their family reunification to Iceland.</narrative>
  </description>
